WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.235
WOMAN:<i> Don't even worry about
 getting the education,</i>

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:04.270
<i> just do what you need to do
 on the field.</i>

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:08.641
MIKE SHAW:
<i>So many kids get it sugarcoated.</i>

00:00:08.941 --> 00:00:10.810
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:12.945
'Cause everybody's
telling them

00:00:13.045 --> 00:00:14.514
they're the best player
in the world.

00:00:17.383 --> 00:00:19.385
SHAMAR GRAVES:<i> You send
young kids on a roller coaster.</i>

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:21.487
<i> You recruit 'em,
 you bring 'em in.</i>

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:24.323
<i>As soon as we sign you switch up
 and you're here for a job.</i>

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.125
(COACHES AND PLAYERS WAR CHANT)

00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:27.527
GRAVES:
<i> But then, you don't pay me.</i>

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.399
REPORTER:<i> What's at stake
 for a university,</i>

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:36.635
<i> if a player makes money
 off their own likeness?</i>

00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:41.574
The coaches are making millions
coaching players

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.777
<i> whose families live
 below the poverty line.</i>

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:47.613
SHAW:<i> I thought I'd be playing
 professionally right now.</i>

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:49.782
<i> I never would've expected
 to be here.</i>

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:52.351
MAN:<i> They're propelling
 a billion-dollar industry,</i>

00:00:52.452 --> 00:00:54.253
and gettin' a sweatsuit for it.

00:00:54.353 --> 00:00:56.423
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:00:57.389 --> 00:00:59.159 line:0%
-(LOCKER CLANGS)
-(BASKETBALL NET SWISHES)

